	"finding %s": "找到%s",
	"DISCOVERIES · %d / %d": "发现 · %d / %d",
	"[color=#b6f28a]✔ %s[/color] (Day %d) - [font_size=13]%s[/font_size]\n": "[color=#b6f28a]✔ %s[/color]（第%d天）- [font_size=13]%s[/font_size]\n",
	"Herbs %d": "草药 %d",
	"Copper %d": "铜 %d",
	"Tin %d": "锡 %d",
	"Houses 3 people. At night 3 sleep inside, warm and safe from wolves.": "可住 3 人。夜里 3 人睡在里面，暖和又不怕狼。",
	"Houses 5 people, and 5 can sleep inside at night.": "可住 5 人，夜里能睡 5 人。",
	"A ring of stakes: people inside it get +3 DEF. Floods can't wash it away.": "一圈木桩：圈内的人防御 +3。洪水冲不垮它。",
	"Steady food from the river (less in winter).": "从河里稳定获得食物（冬天减少）。",
	"Warmth: nobody near it freezes, the sick heal faster, and those who don't fit in huts sleep around it. Lights up the land around it.": "温暖：靠近它的人不会冻伤，病人好得更快，住不进小屋的人围着它睡。照亮周围的土地。",
	"People near it fight with +20% ATK.": "附近的人作战攻击 +20%。",
	"A trickle of lore. Rituals near it give 50% more lore, and the sick nearby heal faster.": "缓缓产生学识。在它附近举行仪式多得 50% 学识，附近的病人好得更快。",
	"Steady food from the field (none in winter, less in drought).": "从田里稳定获得食物（冬天没有，旱季减少）。",
	"Stores 100 more food (food over the stores' limit rots fast). Houses 4 people, and gatherers drop food here, so build it near the fields.": "多储存 100 食物（超出储量的食物会很快腐烂）。可住 4 人，采集者也会把食物送到这里，所以最好建在田地附近。",
	"Summons Yinglong the winged dragon to guard the village. Rituals and healing as a shrine. Needed for Victory by Wisdom.": "召唤应龙守护村庄。兼有神龛的仪式与疗愈之效。智慧胜利所必需。",
	"Home to up to 2 pack oxen. Each ox eats food and needs tending, and lets one gatherer carry 50% more.": "最多养 2 头驮牛。每头牛都要吃粮、要照料，并能让一名采集者多背 50%。",
	"Arms the tribe in bronze (+60% ATK, +3 DEF) while it has copper and tin; it uses one of each per day.": "有铜和锡时，让部落以青铜武装（攻击 +60%，防御 +3）；每天各消耗一份。",
	"A trickle of lore. Where the chiefs of the clans can meet: needed for Victory by Unity.": "缓缓产生学识。各部落首领在此议事：团结胜利所必需。",
	"Where the tribe lays its dead to rest.": "部落安葬逝者的地方。",
	"Eclipse": "日食",
	"River in flood": "河水泛滥",
	"River rising": "河水上涨",
	"Eruption": "火山喷发",
	"Ashfall": "火山灰",
	"Wildfire": "山火",
	"Lightning sets the %s on fire! It must be rebuilt.": "闪电点燃了%s！必须重建。",
	"struck by lightning": "遭雷击身亡",
	"Struck by lightning!": "遭雷击！",
	"Lightning strikes %s - and they live! The sky has touched them.": "闪电击中了%s——而他们活了下来！上天触碰过他们。",
	"was struck by lightning on Day %d and lived - touched by the sky": "被闪电击中却活了下来，受过上天的触碰（第%d天）",
	"Fire from the sky! %s carries a burning branch home. The tribe has seen how fire lives.": "天降之火！%s把一根燃烧的树枝带回了家。部落亲眼见到了火是如何存活的。",
	"carried fire from a lightning-struck tree on Day %d": "从被雷劈中的树上取回了火种（第%d天）",
	"Wildfire! The forest is burning.": "山火！森林烧起来了。",
	"burned in the wildfire": "葬身山火",
	"The wildfire burns the %s!": "山火烧毁了%s！",
	"The wildfire burns out: %d trees are lost. In time, berries will sprout in the ashes.": "山火熄灭了：烧毁了 %d 棵树。假以时日，灰烬里会长出浆果。",
	"The river is rising! Get away from the banks.": "河水在上涨！快离开河岸。",
	"swept away by the river": "被河水卷走",
	"The river falls back. The silt it left will feed the riverside fields.": "河水退去了。留下的淤泥将滋养河边的田地。",
	" Damaged: %s.": " 受损：%s。",
	"The river floods its banks!%s%s": "河水漫过了河岸！%s%s",
	" %d caught by the water.": "%d 人被水困住。",
	"saw the river flood in the spring of Year %d": "见证了第 %d 年春天的河水泛滥",
	"The ground trembles. Black smoke pours from the Fire Mountain.": "大地在颤抖。火山冒出滚滚黑烟。",
	"The Fire Mountain erupts! Fire runs down its slopes and ash darkens the sky.": "火山喷发了！烈火沿山坡奔流而下，火山灰遮暗了天空。",
	"burned by the Fire Mountain": "葬身火山烈焰",
	"saw the Fire Mountain erupt on Day %d": "目睹了火山喷发（第%d天）",
	"A shadow bites into the sun...": "一道阴影咬进了太阳……",
	"The sun returns.": "太阳回来了。",
	"The elders": "长老们",
	"The Sun Is Devoured": "天狗食日",
	"At midday a black mouth eats the sun. Birds fall silent, the air turns cold, and stars come out in the day. The people cry out and look to you.": "正午时分，一张黑色的大口吞下了太阳。鸟儿噤声，空气变冷，白昼里竟出现了星星。众人惊呼，望向你。",
	"Beat the drums": "击鼓驱兽",
	"Drive off the sky-beast with drums and shouting. (+devotion, the tribe grows more martial)": "用鼓声和呐喊赶走天上的野兽。（虔诚 +，部落更尚武）",
	"Offer food to the sky": "向上天献食",
	"Feed the hungry sky. (+devotion, the tribe grows more spiritual)": "供养饥饿的上天。（虔诚 +，部落更崇尚灵性）",
	"Let %s read the omen": "让%s解读征兆",
	"Only a wise shaman (Lore 3+) or the knowledge of the Megalithic Totems can calm the people - otherwise they panic.": "只有睿智的巫师（学识 3 级以上）或巨石图腾的知识能安抚众人——否则人们会陷入恐慌。",
	"beat the drums to drive the sky-beast from the sun on Day %d": "击鼓把天上的野兽从太阳边赶走（第%d天）",
	"The drums thunder and the people howl at the sky. Slowly, the beast spits out the sun.": "鼓声如雷，众人朝天嘶吼。渐渐地，那野兽把太阳吐了出来。",
	"offered food to the devoured sun on Day %d": "向被吞噬的太阳献上食物（第%d天）",
	"The offering burns on the fire. The sky is fed, and gives the sun back.": "祭品在火中燃烧。上天吃饱了，把太阳还了回来。",
	"read the omen of the devoured sun and calmed the tribe on Day %d": "解读了太阳被吞的征兆，安抚了部落（第%d天）",
	"%s points to the old marks on the totems: \"The sun has been eaten before, and always it returns.\" The people grow calm, and learn.": "%s指着图腾上古老的刻痕：“太阳从前也被吞过，而它总会回来。”众人平静下来，也学到了东西。",
	"hid in terror when the sun was devoured on Day %d": "太阳被吞时惊恐地躲了起来（第%d天）",
	"%s has no answer. Panic! The people drop their work and hide in their huts until the light returns.": "%s答不上来。恐慌！众人丢下手中的活，躲进小屋，直到光明重现。",
	"The shaman": "巫师",
	"crushed when the earth shook": "在地震中被压死",
	" Fallen: %s.": " 倒塌：%s。",
	"The earth shakes!%s A rockslide bares new stone in the hills.": "大地震动！%s山间的塌方露出了新的石料。",
	"felt the earth shake on Day %d": "经历了地震（第%d天）",
	"Chieftain, the forest is burning around the camp! We are %d%% done - %s may be lost.": "首领，营地周围的森林烧起来了！我们已完成 %d%%——%s可能保不住了。",
	"Chieftain, the Fire Mountain spits fire and ash over us! We are %d%% done - %s may be lost.": "首领，火山向我们喷吐火焰和灰烬！我们已完成 %d%%——%s可能保不住了。",
	"Chieftain, the earth shook and our work fell down! We are %d%% done - %s may be lost.": "首领，大地震动，我们的工程倒塌了！我们已完成 %d%%——%s可能保不住了。",
	"Obsidian": "黑曜石",
	"Black glass left on the slopes of the Fire Mountain: blades of it cut deep (+15% ATK until bronze).": "火山山坡上留下的黑色玻璃：用它做的刀刃锋利无比（青铜之前攻击 +15%）。",
	"Gathering obsidian": "采集黑曜石",
	"Fire Mountain": "火山",
	"climbed toward the smoking Fire Mountain, where the rocks are warm and the ground growls": "攀上冒烟的火山，那里岩石温热，大地低吼",
	"Hiding in a hut": "躲在小屋里",
	"Chronicle": "编年史",
	"Task Contracts": "任务契约",
	"Task Contracts (%d)": "任务契约（%d）",
	"the village": "村子",
	"%s moves to '%s', where there are empty beds.": "%s搬到了「%s」，那里还有空床位。",
	"moved to '%s' on Day %d": "搬到了「%s」（第%d天）",
	"Of the %s (%s).": "属于%s（%s）。",
	"A dangerous beast. Fight it with several people, or stay near the fires.": "危险的野兽。要么多人一起对付它，要么待在火堆旁。",
	"Visited by the tribe.": "部落已经到过这里。",
	"Not yet visited: send someone there to see what it holds.": "尚未到访：派人去看看那里有什么。",
	"The Ford": "浅滩",
	"A shallow crossing of the river. People and beasts wade across here; elsewhere the river is too deep.": "河上的浅水渡口。人和野兽都从这里涉水过河；别处河水太深。",
	"Someone with Lore might know what it is.": "有学识的人或许认得它。",
	"Someone who knows stone-working might know what it is.": "懂得石器的人或许认得它。",
	"Walk someone up to it to find out.": "派人走近看看就知道了。",
	"Something unfamiliar": "不认识的东西",
	"Left: %d": "剩余：%d",
	"Tree": "树",
	"Wood: %d left. Felled trees regrow in time.": "木材：剩 %d。砍倒的树假以时日会重新长出来。",
	"Stump": "树桩",
	"Burnt tree": "烧焦的树",
	"A tree will grow here again.": "这里还会长出树来。",
	"Berry bush": "浆果丛",
	"Food: %d. Berries regrow, but not in winter.": "食物：%d。浆果会再长，但冬天不长。",
	"Stone outcrop": "石头露头",
	"Stone: %d. Needs Polished Stone Tools to quarry.": "石料：%d。需要磨制石器才能开采。",
	"Deer": "鹿",
	"Hunt it for food. Half the herds leave in winter.": "猎它获取食物。冬天半数鹿群会离开。",
	"Carcass": "兽尸",
	"Meat to butcher: %d food.": "可宰的肉：%d 食物。",
	"Belongs to the %s.": "属于%s。",
	"Being built: %d%%.": "建造中：%d%%。",
	"Awaiting wood.": "等待木材。",
	"Asleep inside: %s": "在里面睡觉：%s",
	"Here lie: %s": "长眠于此：%s",
	"Food %d of %d storage: the village holds %d, each Granary %d more. Food over the limit rots fast.": "食物 %d / %d 储量：村子能存 %d，每座粮仓再多存 %d。超出上限的食物会很快腐烂。",
	"The stores are full and food is rotting on the ground. Build a Granary to keep more.": "仓储满了，食物堆在地上腐烂。建一座粮仓来多存些。",
	"BURIAL GROUND · %d laid to rest": "墓地 · 安葬了 %d 人",
	"[color=#8a7a60]No one rests here yet.[/color]": "[color=#8a7a60]这里还没有人长眠。[/color]",
	"Fell on Day %d: %s.": "第 %d 天倒下：%s。",
	"The body was never found; a stone keeps the name (Day %d).": "遗体始终没有找到，一块石头刻着这个名字（第 %d 天）。",
	"Laid to rest on Day %d.": "第 %d 天入土安葬。",
	"Remembered: %s": "人们记得：%s",
	"Joyful": "欢欣",
	"Content": "安乐",
	"Uneasy": "不安",
	"Gloomy": "消沉",
	"Despairing": "绝望",
	"The people grumble and work without heart. A festival, art or a full belly would lift them.": "众人牢骚满腹，干活提不起劲。一场节庆、一些手艺或一顿饱饭能让他们振作起来。",
	"came of age before the whole tribe on Day %d": "在全部落面前成年（第%d天）",
	"%s comes of age. The tribe gathers at the fire to welcome a new grown member.": "%s成年了。部落众人围坐火边，迎接一位新的成年族人。",
	"%s comes of age!": "%s成年了！",
	"Painted!": "画好了！",
	"+%d goods": "+%d 手工品",
	"made the %s, a treasure of the tribe, on Day %d": "做出了部落珍宝「%s」（第%d天）",
	"%s has made a masterpiece: the %s! The whole tribe comes to see it.": "%s做出了一件杰作：%s！全部落的人都来观看。",
	"The first green shoots are up and the birds are back. The elders ask whether the tribe will hold the Festival of Renewal.": "第一批嫩芽冒出来了，鸟儿也飞回来了。长老们问，部落要不要举行复苏节。",
	"The berries are heavy and the herds are fat. The elders ask whether the tribe will hold the Harvest Festival before the cold.": "浆果压弯了枝头，兽群膘肥体壮。长老们问，要不要在天冷之前举行丰收节。",
	"Winter has come. The elders ask whether the tribe will light the Long Night Fire, to sing the sun back.": "冬天来了。长老们问，要不要点燃长夜之火，把太阳唱回来。",
	"A great festival": "盛大节庆",
	"Feast, dance and drum around the bonfire. Costs %d food and an afternoon's work. (Mood +25, devotion +8, friendly clans come.)": "围着篝火宴饮、舞蹈、击鼓。花费 %d 食物和一下午的活计。（心情 +25，虔诚 +8，友好部落会来）",
	"A small gathering": "小型聚会",
	"Songs at the fire. Costs %d food. (Mood +12, devotion +3)": "在火边唱歌。花费 %d 食物。（心情 +12，虔诚 +3）",
	"No festival this time": "这次不办节庆",
	"Keep everyone working. (Mood -10, devotion -3)": "让大家继续干活。（心情 -10，虔诚 -3）",
	"danced at the %s on Day %d": "在%s上跳舞（第%d天）",
	"Guests of the %s come to share it.": "%s的客人也来一同庆祝。",
	"Drums and fire until dusk: the %s is a night the tribe will remember.": "鼓声与火光直到黄昏：这次%s将让部落久久难忘。",
	"sang at the %s on Day %d": "在%s上唱歌（第%d天）",
	"The tribe gathers at the fire for songs and stories.": "部落众人聚在火边，唱歌讲故事。",
	"No festival this time. The people work on, but their hearts are heavy.": "这次没有节庆。众人继续干活，心情却很沉重。",
	"%s sets out to trade %d %s with the %s.": "%s带着 %d %s出发，去和%s做交易。",
	"The %s took our goods and drove %s off empty-handed.": "%s抢走了我们的货物，把%s空手赶了回来。",
	"was robbed by the %s when trading on Day %d": "去交易时被%s抢劫（第%d天）",
	"%s is back from the %s: %d %s traded for %s.": "%s从%s回来了：用 %d %s换来了%s。",
	"traded with the %s on Day %d": "与%s做了交易（第%d天）",
	"Mood: %s (%d). Work goes %d%% faster or slower with it. Festivals, art, painted homes and treasures lift it; hunger, sickness and deaths lower it.": "心情：%s（%d）。干活的速度随之快或慢 %d%%。节庆、手艺、彩绘的家和珍宝会提升心情；饥饿、疾病和死亡会降低心情。",
	"Mood %d": "心情 %d",
