	"Craft": "手艺",
	"Tools, pots, huts and the working of metal come faster.": "工具、陶器与冶炼来得更快。",
	"Good hands are worth more than good words.": "一双巧手胜过满口好话。",
	"A better axe will not keep the spirits kind.": "斧子再好，也换不来神灵的善意。",
	"Plants and healing": "草木与疗愈",
	"Fire, farming and the taming of beasts come faster.": "用火、农耕与驯兽来得更快。",
	"Learn the green things, and they feed and heal us.": "懂得草木，它们就会养活我们、治愈我们。",
	"Weeds and roots. The young want spears.": "野草和根茎。年轻人想要的是矛。",
	"The stars and the spirits": "星辰与神灵",
	"Totems and the tribal code come faster.": "图腾与部落法典来得更快。",
	"The sky is a book. We should learn to read it.": "天空是一本书。我们该学着去读。",
	"Stargazers starve.": "看星星的人会饿死。",
	"War": "战争",
	"Weapons, hides and bronze come faster; the warriors grow proud.": "兵器、皮甲与青铜来得更快；战士们日渐骄傲。",
	"Our neighbours have spears. We need sharper ones.": "邻居们有矛。我们需要更锋利的。",
	"Seek war, and war will find us.": "追求战争，战争就会找上门来。",
	"Stance toward clans": "对待氏族的态度",
	"How the tribe meets its neighbours.": "部落如何对待邻居。",
	"Peace first": "以和为先",
	"Gifts and open hands: the clans warm to us over time, but our warriors grow soft.": "赠礼与善意：各氏族会渐渐亲近我们，但我们的战士会变得软弱。",
	"A friend at the river is worth ten spears.": "河边的一个朋友，抵得上十支矛。",
	"They smile at us and count our food.": "他们对我们笑，却在数我们的粮食。",
	"Neither friend nor foe until they show us which.": "在他们表明立场之前，不算朋友也不算敌人。",
	"Watch, and wait.": "观望，等待。",
	"Waiting is not a plan.": "等待不是办法。",
	"Warlike": "好战",
	"We are the strong ones: warriors fight harder, but the clans come to hate us.": "我们是强者：战士更加勇猛，但各氏族会憎恨我们。",
	"War paint is mixed by the fire. The neighbours will hear of it.": "火堆旁调好了战纹颜料。邻居们会听说的。",
